---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Comic Strip Canvas refund and returns policy for made-to-order wall art."
>
  <section class="relative bg-panel-dark py-16">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-comic-red"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 font-source text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-comic-yellow transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-off-white">Refund Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="font-bangers text-5xl text-off-white tracking-wide mb-4" style="text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);">REFUND POLICY</h1>
      <p class="font-source text-gray-400 text-sm">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="space-y-8 font-source text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-russo text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Your Right to Cancel &mdash; Standard Products</h2>
        <p>If you bought a standard (non-personalised) print, you have 14 days from the day you receive it to change your mind, for any reason.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">Tell us within those 14 days &mdash; a message through our <a href="/contact/" class="text-comic-cyan hover:text-comic-yellow transition-colors">contact page</a> with your order number is enough. You then have a further 14 days from telling us to send the item back.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">The item must be unused and returned in its original packaging. You pay the cost of return postage, unless the item is faulty or we sent you the wrong thing &mdash; then we cover it.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We refund the price of the item plus the original standard delivery charge within 14 days of receiving the item back, or within 14 days of you showing us proof of posting, whichever is sooner. We may reduce the refund if the item has been handled more than was necessary to check it &mdash; the same handling you could have given it in a shop.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-russo text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Personalised and Customised Orders</h2>
        <p>The 14-day right to change your mind does not apply to personalised items or to designs made through &ldquo;Customise this design&rdquo;. They are made to your specification &mdash; your photographs, your wording, your layout &mdash; so they cannot be resold, and the law does not give a change-of-mind right on goods made that way. This does not affect your rights if the item arrives faulty, damaged or not as described.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-russo text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Proof Approval</h2>
        <p>You approve your layout in the builder before ordering. We then email the finished artwork with the comic style applied, usually within one working day. If something about the finish isn&rsquo;t right, tell us and we&rsquo;ll look at it; the layout, crop and wording are as you set them. Once you approve the finished artwork, printing begins and the order cannot be cancelled or refunded.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-russo text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Faulty, Damaged or Incorrect Items</h2>
        <p>If your order arrives damaged, with a printing defect, or is not what you ordered &mdash; the wrong size or format, or artwork that differs from the proof you approved &mdash; please contact us within 48 hours of delivery with photographs. Please don&rsquo;t send anything back before speaking to us.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">We cover the cost of the return, and you choose a replacement or a full refund. This applies to every product we sell, personalised ones included.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-russo text-off-white text-lg uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">How to Contact Us</h2>
        <p>For any issues with your order, please <a href="/contact/" class="text-comic-cyan hover:text-comic-yellow transition-colors">contact us</a> with your order details and photographs where applicable. We aim to respond within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
